# Cursor Rules - SEO, AEO, & GEO Master Skill

When performing SEO, AEO, or GEO tasks:
1. Refer to `SKILL.md` for core rules, character limits (Title <60c, Meta <150c, Alt <65c, Speed <2s), and heading rules (80% subheadings containing keyword).
2. Follow `references/03_aeo_answer_engine_optimization.md` for AI Overviews and 25-45 word lead-with-answer blocks.
3. Follow `references/04_geo_generative_engine_optimization.md` for ChatGPT/Perplexity LLM citations (Information Gain, Reddit/Quora brand mentions).
4. Run the 67-point checklist in `references/05_unified_triad_framework_and_checklists.md`.
